---

### **1. Setup Programmable Search Engine (PSE)**
- **Create a Custom Search Engine** in the [Google Custom Search Engine (CSE) Console](https://cse.google.com/cse/).
  - Add your company names as search terms.
  - Get the **Search Engine ID (CSE ID)**.
